  "question": {
    "html": "<p>Two spaceships, X and Y move in opposite directions away from a space station. The speeds of the spaceships relative to the space station are <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"u\"></span> and <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"v\"></span>.</p>\n<p><figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure></p>\n<p>What is the speed of Y in the reference frame of X?</p>\n<p>[1]</p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{u-v}{1-\\frac{uv}{c^{2}}}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{u-v}{1+\\frac{uv}{c^{2}}}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{u+v}{1-\\frac{uv}{c^{2}}}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{u+v}{1+\\frac{uv}{c^{2}}}\"></span></li></ol>"
  },
